{"id": "DfYWAr_oryo", "title": "Video by vigyan_bhairav__", "description": "Method 7: The Twelve Sounds 🔔🪷🕉️\n\nIn the Vigyan Bhairav Tantra, Bhairav reveals 112 ways to know yourself. This is the seventh.\n\nIn Method 6, the power rose like lightning through six chakras. Now, Bhairav climbs more slowly, through twelve centres and twelve sounds.\n\nThe twelve centres rise, one above the other. In each one, you meditate on a single vowel:\n\nJanmagra: a\nMula: aa\nKanda: i\nNabhi, the navel: ee\nHridaya, the heart: u\nKantha, the throat: oo\nTalu, the palate: ay\nBhrumadhya, between the brows: ai\nLalata, the forehead: o\nBrahmarandhra, the crown: au\nShakti: am\nVyapini: ah\n\nAs you rise, the gross falls away (sthula). Then the subtle falls away too (sukshma).\n\nWhat remains is the supreme state (para), full of light. ✨\n\nLet go, and let go again.\n\nAnd in the end, only Shiva remains. 🔱\n\n🧘 Try it: sit quietly and start at the base of your body. Silently hold one vowel at each centre as you move upward, without rushing. At the top, let the sounds go and rest. Comment 🔔 if you felt the stillness.\n\n📖 Vigyan Bhairav Tantra, Dharana 7 (verse 30)\n⬅️ New here? Start with Method 1 on my page.\nFollow for one method at a time 🪷\n\n#VigyanBhairavTantra #VigyanBhairav #Bhairava #Shiva #Shakti #Tantra #KashmirShaivism #Mantra #SacredSound #NadaYoga #Vowels #Brahmarandhra #InnerLight #LettingGo #Meditation #SoundMeditation #Mindfulness #SpiritualAwakening #Consciousness #Yoga #Mahadev #HarHarMahadev #Ukiyoe #WoodblockPrint #MeditationReels #SpiritualReels #ReelsIndia", "channel": "vigyan_bhairav__", "uploader_id": "70392958166", "uploader": "Bhairav", "timestamp": 1793925794, "like_count": 490, "comment_count": 10, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5",